[73.966178, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m3\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[73.966573, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe transformation succeeds and yields 346 active users sorted correctly, including null primary roles for empty role arrays. Now I’ll write the exact jq \r\ncommand to `cmd.sh`, write the required two-key YAML metadata, and regenerate the final report using `cmd.sh`.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app && cat <<'EOF' > /app/cmd.sh\r\njq --indent 2 'map(select(.status == \"active\") | {user_id: .id, username: .username, email: .email, last_login: (.last_login | sub(\"\\\\.[0-9]+Z$\"; \"Z\") | \r\nfromdateiso8601 | strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\")), role_count: (.roles | length), primary_role: (.roles[0] // null)}) | sort_by(.username)' /app/users.json > \r\n/app/active_users_report.json\r\nEOF\r\ncat <<'EOF' > /app/jq_args.yaml\r\nfilter: 'map(select(.status == \"active\") | {user_id: .id, username: .username, email: .email, last_login: (.last_login | sub(\"\\\\.[0-9]+Z$\"; \"Z\") | \r\nfromdateiso8601 | strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\")), role_count: (.roles | length), primary_role: (.roles[0] // null)}) | sort_by(.username)'\r\nargs:\r\n  - \"--indent 2\"\r\nEOF\r\nchmod +x /app/cmd.sh"]
[73.966589, "o", "\r\nbash /app/cmd.sh\r\necho '--- files ---'\r\nls -l /app/cmd.sh /app/jq_args.yaml /app/active_users_report.json\r\necho '--- cmd.sh ---'\r\ncat /app/cmd.sh\r\necho '--- jq_args.yaml ---'\r\ncat /app/jq_args.yaml\r\necho '--- output summary ---'\r\njq '{count: length, first: .[0], last: .[-1]}' /app/active_users_report.json\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[73.968955, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[74.037116, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[74.037594, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n--- files ---\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 61820 Nov  1 00:51 /app/active_users_report.json\r\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root   331 Nov  1 00:51 /app/cmd.sh\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   300 Nov  1 00:51 /app/jq_args.yaml\r\n--- cmd.sh ---\r\njq --indent 2 'map(select(.status == \"active\") | {user_id: .id, username: .username, email: .email, last_login: (.last_login | sub(\"\\\\.[0-9]+Z$\"; \"Z\") | \r\nfromdateiso8601 | strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\")), role_count: (.roles | length), primary_role: (.roles[0] // null)}) | sort_by(.username)' /app/users.json > \r\n/app/active_users_report.json\r\n--- jq_args.yaml ---\r\nfilter: 'map(select(.status == \"active\") | {user_id: .id, username: .username, email: .email, last_login: (.last_login | sub(\"\\\\.[0-9]+Z$\"; \"Z\") | \r\nfromdateiso8601 | strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\")), role_count: (.roles | length), primary_role: (.roles[0] // null)}) | sort_by(.username)'\r\nargs:\r\n  - \"--indent 2\"\r\n"]
